<title>THAILAND: TelecomAsia says to pay no 1996 dividend.</title>
<headline>TelecomAsia says to pay no 1996 dividend.</headline>
<dateline>BANGKOK 1997-03-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Thai telecommunications company TelecomAsia Plc will pay no dividend for the 12 months to December 31, 1996, the company said in a statement to the Stock Exchange of Thailand on Tuesday.</p>
<p>TelecomAsia, which operates fixed telephone lines, posted a 1.92 billion baht ($73.8 million) loss in 1996.</p>
<p>($1 = 26 baht)</p>
<p>-- Bangkok newsroom (662) 652-0642</p>
</text>
